hacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50" "basis" 315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319198" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, notice that\n\n$$\nc=2i-5j+k=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo compute $4c-3d,$ we need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4c-3d & =4\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]-3\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -23 \\\\ 10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =⟨-4,-23,10⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50" "basis" 315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319198" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c21473d08b4e2de9e8fd406c55816c6376f510c3c359f304b623754e06117f5" "basis" 315 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-319198" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a