 component individually:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2b & =(-2)\\cdot ⟨-1,7,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(-2)\\cdot (-1),(-2)\\cdot 7,(-2)\\cdot 4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,-14,-8⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-1388" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c21473d08b4e2de9e8fd406c55816c6376f510c3c359f304b623754e06117f5"} {"question" "q-1388" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-1388" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(-3,5,2)"] ["math" "⟨-1,7,4⟩"] ["math" "⟨-2,-14,-8⟩"] ["math" "⟨2,-14,-8⟩"] ["math" "⟨2,14,8⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-1388" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨2,-14,-8⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $d=9i+7j+4k,$ $e=-i+2k$ and $f=i+7j-9k.$ Find $d-(3e+f).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To compute $d-(3e+f),$ we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d-(3e+f) & =9i+7j+4k-(3(-i+2k)+(i+7j-9k)) \\\\  & =9i+7j+4k-((-3i+6k)+(i+7j-9k)) \\\\  & =9i+7j+4k-(-2i+7j-3k) \\\\  & =11i+7k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c21473d08b4e2de9e8fd406c55816c6376f510c3c359f304b623754e06117f5"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "11i+7k"] ["math" "11i-7k"] ["math" "7i+14j+k"] ["math" "9i+35j-24k"] ["math" "9i-14j+32k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-100997" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "11i+7k"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $a=4i-2j,$ find $3a.$\n\n$3a=$\n{{field-1}} $i$\n$-$\n{{field-2}} $j$\n$+$\n{{field-3}} $k$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To compute the product, we multiply each component individually:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3a & =3\\cdot (4i-2j) \\\\  & =3\\cdot (4i-2j+0k) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4i+3\\cdot (-2j)+3\\cdot 0k \\\\  & =12\\,i-6\\,j+0\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2c21473d08b4e2de9e8fd406c55816c6376f510c3c359f304b623754e06117f5"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "12"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13929637/state.json" "file_sha256" "248ca934f26036cec6bfcec098dd3d60d5a749cecf9ac6fcefb559b63d5b4c50"} {"question" "q-318460" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-f